rated, making it an ideal compilation for both new and dedicated readers of Orwell's work."},"tableOfContents":"Such, such were the joys ... -- Charles Dickens -- The art of Donald McGill -- Rudyard Kipling -- Raffles and Miss Blandish -- Shooting an elephant -- Politics and the English language -- Reflections on Gandhi -- Marrakech -- Looking back on the Spanish war -- Inside the whale -- England your England -- Boys' weeklies -- Why I write.","note":{"@type":"statement of responsibility","#text":"George Orwell."},"subject":{"@authority":"lcsh","name":{"@type":"personal","namePart":["Orwell, George",{"@type":"date","#text":"1903-1950"}]}},"classification":{"@authority":"lcc","#text":"PR6029.R8 A16 1954"},"relatedItem":[{"titleInfo":{"title":"Harbrace paperbound library, HPL 48"}},{"@otherType":"HOLLIS record","location":{"url":"https://id.lib.harvard.edu/alma/990003448560203941/catalog"}}],"identifier":[{"@type":"isbn","#text":"0156186004 (pbk.)"},{"@type":"lccn","@invalid":"yes","#text":"^^^54007594^"},{"@type":"oclc","#text":"11586619"}],"location":[{"physicalLocation":{"@displayLabel":"Harvard repository","@type":"repository","@valueURI":"http://isni.org/isni/0000000463633307","#text":"Lamont Library, Harvard University"},"shelfLocator":"PR6029.R8 A16 1953x"},{"physicalLocation":{"@displayLabel":"Harvard repository","@type":"repository","@valueURI":"http://isni.org/isni/0000000460342846","#text":"Monroe C. Gutman Library, Graduate School of Education, Harvard University"},"shelfLocator":"PR6029.R8 A16 1953"},null,null],"extension":[{"librarycloud":{"HarvardRepositories":{"HarvardRepository":["Gutman Education","Lamont"]},"originalDocument":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/harvard.librarycloud.marc/990003448560203941","priorrecordids":{"recordIdentifier":{"@source":"MH:ALEPH","#text":"000344856"}},"processingDate":"2024-10-26T08:05Z"}},{"sets":null}],"recordInfo":{"descriptionStandard":"aacr","recordContentSource":{"@authority":"marcorg","#text":"HMG"},"recordCreationDa